        {
            "command": "shuf",
            "description": "LC_ALL=C、LANG=C下执行shuf -i 1-2 --random-source=/dev/null；随机源在实际取样时立即EOF，GNU返回RC=1、stdout为空、stderr为shuf: '/dev/null': end of file加换行，不能panic。",
            "args": [
                "-i",
                "1-2",
                "--random-source=/dev/null"
            ],
            "expectation": {
                "execution": {
                    "exit_code": 1,
                    "stdout": "",
                    "stderr": "shuf: '/dev/null': end of file\n"
                }
            },
            "environment": {
                "env_vars": {
                    "LC_ALL": "C",
                    "LANG": "C"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "command": "shuf",
            "description": "LC_ALL=C、LANG=C下执行shuf -i 1-1 --random-source=/dev/null；单一候选项无需消耗随机字节，GNU返回RC=0、stdout为1加换行、stderr为空。",
            "args": [
                "-i",
                "1-1",
                "--random-source=/dev/null"
            ],
            "expectation": {
                "execution": {
                    "exit_code": 0,
                    "stdout": "1\n",
                    "stderr": ""
                }
            },
            "environment": {
                "env_vars": {
                    "LC_ALL": "C",
                    "LANG": "C"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "command": "shuf",
            "description": "LC_ALL=C、LANG=C下执行shuf -e first second -n 1 --random-source=/dev/null；多项输入即使仅输出一项也必须取样，GNU返回RC=1、stdout为空、stderr为shuf: '/dev/null': end of file加换行。",
            "args": [
                "-e",
                "first",
                "second",
                "-n",
                "1",
                "--random-source=/dev/null"
            ],
            "expectation": {
                "execution": {
                    "exit_code": 1,
                    "stdout": "",
                    "stderr": "shuf: '/dev/null': end of file\n"
                }
            },
            "environment": {
                "env_vars": {
                    "LC_ALL": "C",
                    "LANG": "C"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "command": "shuf",
            "description": "原始字节用例：LC_ALL=C、LANG=C下执行shuf -e $'a\\n' -n 2 --random-source=/dev/zero -o echo-output；参数完整十六进制=2d65 610a 2d6e 32 2d2d72616e646f6d2d736f757263653d2f6465762f7a65726f 2d6f 6563686f2d6f7574707574，第二个echo参数为2字节a加换行。GNU会为每个-e参数追加换行并保留已有换行后的空项；随机顺序不约束，验证echo-output完整长度为3字节，RC=0、stdout和stderr均为0字节。",
            "args": [
                "2d65",
                "610a",
                "2d6e",
                "32",
                "2d2d72616e646f6d2d736f757263653d2f6465762f7a65726f",
                "2d6f",
                "6563686f2d6f7574707574"
            ],
            "expectation": {
                "execution": {
                    "exit_code": 0,
                    "stdout": "",
                    "stderr": ""
                },
                "verifications": [
                    {
                        "command": "test \"$(wc -c < echo-output)\" -eq 3",
                        "expected_exit": 0,
                        "expected_stdout": "",
                        "expected_stderr": ""
                    }
                ]
            },
            "environment": {
                "env_vars": {
                    "LC_ALL": "C",
                    "LANG": "C"
                }
            },
            "cleanup_commands": [
                "rm -f echo-output"
            ],
            "byteMode": true
        },
        {
            "command": "shuf",
            "description": "LC_ALL=C、LANG=C下执行shuf -i 1-1并将stdout连接到/dev/full；随机范围固定为唯一值1，GNU在最终输出刷新失败时返回RC=1、stdout为空、stderr为shuf: write error: No space left on device加换行。",
            "args": [
                "-i",
                "1-1"
            ],
            "expectation": {
                "execution": {
                    "exit_code": 1,
                    "stdout": "",
                    "stderr": "shuf: write error: No space left on device\n"
                }
            },
            "environment": {
                "env_vars": {
                    "LC_ALL": "C",
                    "LANG": "C"
                },
                "standardStreams": {
                    "stdout": "full"
                }
            }
